      "subject": "fix(education): Learning Records are knowledge, not curriculum (ADR-0045)",
      "body": "Continuous learning makes each Learning Record canonical (ADR-0042), and education admitted them into the Day-0 curriculum, where each lacked an educational authority resolution: the corpus candidate went incomplete and the corpus, competency, human acceptance and workspace authorization certifications read blocked after every owner commit. Education no longer admits authority class learning; Learning Records stay canonical and reach reasoning through canonical knowledge. With it, every certification is valid against the exact candidate the owner certified on 2026-10-17, with no re-certification. Runtime suites 1571/1571.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
